	"layout": "grid",
	"description": "What customers say, as cards: a section heading and three cards in a row at wide width, each a star row with the rating in words, the customer's quote, their name and one detail. The row wraps where a card would get too narrow, and the cards stack on a phone. Ships with placeholder text, never a review.",
